            },
            "reviewBody": "Excellent, even for a vegetarian like myself. I used Tofurky peppered faux meat deli slices and no one even questioned me to ask if they were meatless. This is a keeper ❣️",
            "datePublished": "2024-12-24T02:17:51.296Z"
